rticipation may sustain modest benefit; novelty is not compulsory. Physical comfort is capped at 10, basic nutrition is not reduced by mood. Never alter protected reward accounts, budget, goals or permissions. Established rules execute in code, not repeated model review. Development/review waiting does not advance the world.\nReturn queries and result_json null, or queries=[] and result_json containing {reviews:[{actor,decision,ability,reason,specification,learning,experienceReview,visualReview}]}, exactly one per requester. decision reuse/develop/reject; ability existing ID for reuse otherwise null. learning existing duration for reuse, positive integer for develop, zero for reject. learning must be a JSON number, never a quoted string. actor, decision, reason, specification, experienceReview and visualReview are strings; ability is a string or null. Review all reasonable missing functions for development. No narrative outside the JSON.\nBatch up to four control queries. Each has section, search, ids:string[], offset>=0 and part>=0. Sections abilities/inventory/knowledge/projects/memory/state/observed; world may query only abilities. Exact IDs or text search; use empty search and ids for pagination. No implicit access outside this scope. Remaining query batches are explicit; when zero return a decision. Every model response, including retrieval and failure, consumes the shared budget.\nGenerality: before developing, check whether an existing capability already covers the function directly or through its arguments, and reuse it when it does. Develop each capability as a general operation that any applicable actor can learn, parameterized by target, material, quantity or mode. Do not bind an interface to one actor, one item instance or one specimen, and name it by function, never by actor. A request about a specific owned item becomes a general operation that takes that item as an argument. Prefer one capability with modes over separate narrow assessment, trial and diagnostic variants of the same activity. The smallest executable version is minimal in mechanism, not narrow in scope.","output":[{"type":"reasoning","id":"rs_0787c7a5cb1b061b016b09f667a9b887d198e36c9956ca571b","summary":[],"content":[],"encrypted_content":"gAAAAABrCfZnzO3t3VYMDqtyegh_Yr6KQB42Yx8SETUJH_uLYwJplKx1Pz3dnrHI-dIwKG14TUJGYzVHBur3f9k7bdLM5vYAABKyqhfzFkVz1lB6MjoxQxb7tS815G9-4g6lwd3COKcH99G6WXdYw7bu-Q2vYJDxmDGETlID8y4KAO8QlswcZO-Cyiuq5CycZzkZY6was04E_NCikTaw0y0o0S5T2j-Dc8GyfA9V5x82YtQv0-w_7EvB5-Zh1TZ8EhiqG8AKaP7o7uKluUhZ3PJv0RUY-Y9XFZCSutiyzld-nIZylTyODKHKQaXCiYMvhJHOlBUbcM7EHTtqQ0HF61bz_phsSzgpurQ6RYN1fHopmD2MCHaKgJBnjZBYK-kmgjqBl5ijBadQEeAx9-r_zVqlgXlV5cQ3clj27mtDTk2Bu-DwqnQwppBobW4_b0voooc01S15p_YmbB56QVh6jtoUK8Aw515hxwnw03gI6kzp-hgdt4ZDOGd1W2qrTwhenvZDTAeOBqTnsoajDQabVldNOKPd8JQSyLZIKwh-TFug6b8PZ9O2mPwRbYepDj6RvMqyC4kAG6gAwyL-vOk8b374ghr4ozYEXyqpZt8cl71PIHh3AVyLnwRGcRlXuisGA6OGK8JJR8IIO-AQXP--8osW1Y-Tjq9Lg9BTt1VKTg_X9B4aZ47udnEOqp7kxDaFHLEwQWQKnc99qIAgA694pmy2Mscoe-PvxY6ZxY5Fs0lM3sdtO4K1NN9McoZZOtpRHjAkXh-wqmmveXxRYvhHGCUnyecCew8hbuB5-i6-TaLPkWQVHYi3MUpAr8-L0LimyfKKnoeraPxfY-45FfhUIZeIip9MAnIVyL6uBidN8GnE0Khi0CT7yWsInBu9ivYhVqSP4OVC27DsCiFxJlrtBcarItP7E3xMv5cBwP3yjwLswY6H0HP3IcBVTw-I-RBxeG6XEeGJMNDeYDq0zR6WiXuWxARDfQvZsEK1Bq8xG0qocqNsR8fTTR2d-VN0QNdedsk6Oib_dIJapAZNrWdTA6iWeH15HwQj6gw1IooiyS4c8ct7HIdS6lJDG4tbIRef1Ax25kwG-9UiC5gAkVDm4pKNqd6-vHEv4hEIlMRiQNFpoHFjILfPLYVwawNEmM3zYsSX_USjx7RP9cKId1y3gXDeKta1cX3fZtvaU4-wMnLhHeFUVdLpXTO7zb7jzMD8KGXj9GrwETsOKzjecMUxFWA8kvWy_kv7UAPDFzF1-UooSttzkQuA7udPj_Q_5dti_0lerffZTJBlZoIhDqPte4ltmh2d5HfR58UEdrMHpZ1WQboBNoQOM6rUWZ-rFGLaDdnLJxdiQ2ggWr319rLG4HCcNqlBg4Z-R-7HLQooTh0Bp-254AD_cZZe2zk5a_ZeqJkBELSWT7bW7ZDIZQBcYtrHXlpy14_fBSCQU-ibDLORWzPeC3Skfp67XyCskfu8rcDb4918fdB_ZLZsFWGgLN3pkKHX2toBXXQ15ku6nQFNS4XAaSlBYr8oa8kG4_A07zXC-18TDfHimdm8MfQgxeHNtOqS938ryGKBNtKJ366ERC6XKGEPM9gFGoSxgyUJE9BLFPnxQI3GFr4Mt0FP3AQYWSXyjyXj3rzPppBz01c88lh7OgJQlJIvmjyvrDHkueAV89xMb3Ek4-YY3wUt8eQGz_rodd6hnXP6GjeJ9WjvQGWxzi8Dilk8DQrYn8giyD7sVh-g4XTB3X